ys a role here, as its gross margin was 74.9% during Q1."], "original_party": "NVIDIA", "reporting_speaker": "Neil Patel (Motley Fool)", "tier": "fact", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "Q1 FY2027", "figures": [{"measure": "gross margin", "period": "Q1 FY2027", "value": "74.9%", "kind": "actual", "basis": "basis (GAAP vs. non-GAAP) not stated"}], "thesis_ids": ["v3"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, "members": [{"id": "66:e1", "article": 66, "input_id": "gnews:54aa9ce326115cedf8857512", "title": "CAPITAL IDEAS: The lag 7 — Is Micron the new Nvidia?", "publisher": "theberkshireedge.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "In a comparison with Micron, the author cited Nvidia’s latest reported quarter as showing revenue growth of 85%, a GAAP gross margin of 74.9%, and an operating margin of roughly 66%, and said Nvidia still earns more dollars.", "passages": ["Micron’s latest revenue growth was about 346 percent, compared with Nvidia’s 85 percent. Micron’s GAAP gross margin was 84.6 percent, compared with Nvidia’s 74.9 percent. Micron’s operating margin was 80.4 percent, compared with Nvidia’s roughly 66 percent. Nvidia still earns more dollars."], "verified_passages": ["Micron’s latest revenue growth was about 346 percent, compared with Nvidia’s 85 percent. Micron’s GAAP gross margin was 84.6 percent, compared with Nvidia’s 74.9 percent. Micron’s operating margin was 80.4 percent, compared with Nvidia’s roughly 66 percent. Nvidia still earns more dollars."], "original_party": "NVIDIA", "reporting_speaker": "Allen Harris, The Berkshire Edge", "tier": "fact", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "Nvidia's latest reported quarter (period not specified in the item)", "figures": [{"measure": "revenue growth", "period": "latest reported quarter", "value": "85 percent", "kind": "actual", "basis": "Nvidia latest reported quarter; compared with Micron's 346 percent"}, {"measure": "GAAP gross margin", "period": "latest reported quarter", "value": "74.9 percent", "kind": "actual", "basis": "GAAP; compared with Micron's 84.6 percent"}, {"measure": "operating margin", "period": "latest reported quarter", "value": "roughly 66 percent", "kind": "actual", "basis": "compared with Micron's 80.4 percent"}], "thesis_ids": ["v1", "v10", "v3"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}], "links": {"v3": "43:e2", "v1": "66:e1", "v10": "66:e1"}, "revises": []}, "45:e1": {"original": {"id": "45:e1", "article": 45, "input_id": "gnews:552f8c2bdfd080555d592587", "title": "Nvidia's next-gen AI rack system delayed to 2028 on manufacturing snags, SemiAnalysis says", "publisher": "cnbc.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-05", "summary": "Research firm SemiAnalysis said in a post on Monday that Nvidia's Kyber NVL144 rack architecture — the rack-scale system slated to debut with the Vera Rubin Ultra generation in 2027 — has been delayed by more than 12 months to 2028, because the PCB midplane at the heart of the system remains difficult to manufacture. SemiAnalysis added that NVL576, a larger system linking eight racks via optical connections, is also likely delayed or limited to small volumes.", "passages": ["Nvidia 's next marquee product — the Kyber rack-scale architecture designed to house its 2027 Rubin Ultra chips — has been delayed by more than 12 months to 2028, according to research firm SemiAnalysis, the latest in a string of reported setbacks raising questions about the AI giant's product roadmap.", "\"Kyber NVL144 rack architecture has been delayed to 2028 as the PCB midplane remains challenging from a manufacturability standpoint,\" the firm said, referring to a specialized, multi-layer printed circuit board that connects electronic modules within a system.", "NVL576 — a larger system linking eight racks via optical connections — is also likely delayed or limited to small volumes, the research firm said."], "verified_passages": ["Nvidia 's next marquee product — the Kyber rack-scale architecture designed to house its 2027 Rubin Ultra chips — has been delayed by more than 12 months to 2028, according to research firm SemiAnalysis, the latest in a string of reported setbacks raising questions about the AI giant's product roadmap.", "\"Kyber NVL144 rack architecture has been delayed to 2028 as the PCB midplane remains challenging from a manufacturability standpoint,\" the firm said, referring to a specialized, multi-layer printed circuit board that connects electronic modules within a system.", "NVL576 — a larger system linking eight racks via optical connections — is also likely delayed or limited to small volumes, the research firm said."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "SemiAnalysis, reported by CNBC", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": "Monday", "evidence_period": "Calendar 2028 (delay from an original 2027 debut)", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, "members": [{"id": "54:e1", "article": 54, "input_id": "gnews:68a3ed21f77b935d9fa7ec5e", "title": "Jim Cramer Says Buy Nvidia as Chipmaker Rejects 2028 AI Delay Claims", "publisher": "finance.yahoo.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "Research firm SemiAnalysis claimed that Nvidia's Kyber NVL144 high-density rack architecture — the design built for Rubin Ultra GPUs and showcased at GTC earlier in 2026 — has slipped by more than 12 months, blaming persistent manufacturing problems with the system's complex PCB midplane. Nvidia subsequently rejected the claim (see separate item).", "passages": ["The clash pits Nvidia against research firm SemiAnalysis, which alleges manufacturing setbacks have hit the Kyber NVL144 architecture showcased at GTC earlier this year.", "SemiAnalysis claims the high-density rack design built for Rubin Ultra GPUs has slipped by more than 12 months. The firm blamed persistent manufacturing problems with the system's complex PCB midplane."], "verified_passages": ["The clash pits Nvidia against research firm SemiAnalysis, which alleges manufacturing setbacks have hit the Kyber NVL144 architecture showcased at GTC earlier this year.", "SemiAnalysis claims the high-density rack design built for Rubin Ultra GPUs has slipped by more than 12 months. The firm blamed persistent manufacturing problems with the system's complex PCB midplane."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "finance.yahoo.com (Lockridge Okoth, beincrypto.com)", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "Rubin Ultra / Kyber NVL144 schedule, claimed to have slipped by more than 12 months (i.e., into 2028)", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "58:e1", "article": 58, "input_id": "gnews:98a4e8ff0c0260d8dc9e531d", "title": "Nvidia pushes Kyber release to 2028 following manufacturing concerns – report", "publisher": "datacenterdynamics.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "SemiAnalysis reported that Nvidia has delayed production of its Kyber rack-scale architecture by more than 12 months, pushing its release date to 2028 from an originally planned 2027, citing manufacturability problems with the printed circuit board (PCB) midplane that connects the modules.", "passages": ["Nvidia has delayed production of its Kyber rack-scale architecture by more than 12 months, pushing its release date to 2028, SemiAnalysis has reported.", "The Kyber server cabinets, which have been designed to house 144 Rubin Ultra GPUs connected via the company’s NVLink 7 Switch, had originally been slated for release in 2027.", "However, the research firm claimed that issues in manufacturing the printed circuit board (PCB) midplane that connects the modules together have caused the setback.", "“Kyber NVL144 rack architecture has been delayed to 2028 as the PCB midplane remains challenging from a manufacturability standpoint,” SemiAnalysis said"], "verified_passages": ["Nvidia has delayed production of its Kyber rack-scale architecture by more than 12 months, pushing its release date to 2028, SemiAnalysis has reported.", "The Kyber server cabinets, which have been designed to house 144 Rubin Ultra GPUs connected via the company’s NVLink 7 Switch, had originally been slated for release in 2027.", "However, the research firm claimed that issues in manufacturing the printed circuit board (PCB) midplane that connects the modules together have caused the setback.", "“Kyber NVL144 rack architecture has been delayed to 2028 as the PCB midplane remains challenging from a manufacturability standpoint,” SemiAnalysis said"], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "datacenterdynamics.com (Charlotte Trueman)", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "2028 release, delayed from an original 2027 target", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "69:e1", "article": 69, "input_id": "gnews:795ea94e1100415a67fd1a96", "title": "Nvidia's Kyber NVL144 reportedly pushed back more than a year, Asian suppliers drop", "publisher": "the-decoder.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "Analyst firm SemiAnalysis reported on X that Nvidia's next-generation AI server rack system, Kyber NVL144, has been pushed back more than twelve months to 2028 because of manufacturing problems, as reported by the-decoder.com. According to SemiAnalysis, the problem is the circuit boards: the PCB midplane, the central board that connects all the individual components, has proven extremely difficult to produce without defects.", "passages": ["A report from analyst firm SemiAnalysis says Nvidia's next-generation AI server rack has been delayed by more than a year.", "Asian tech stocks slid after analyst firm SemiAnalysis reported on X that Nvidia's next AI server rack system, Kyber NVL144, has been pushed back more than twelve months to 2028 because of manufacturing problems.", "The issue, according to SemiAnalysis, is the circuit boards. Specifically, the PCB midplane, a central board that connects all the individual components, has proven extremely difficult to produce without defects."], "verified_passages": ["A report from analyst firm SemiAnalysis says Nvidia's next-generation AI server rack has been delayed by more than a year.", "Asian tech stocks slid after analyst firm SemiAnalysis reported on X that Nvidia's next AI server rack system, Kyber NVL144, has been pushed back more than twelve months to 2028 because of manufacturing problems.", "The issue, according to SemiAnalysis, is the circuit boards. Specifically, the PCB midplane, a central board that connects all the individual components, has proven extremely difficult to produce without defects."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "SemiAnalysis, reported by the-decoder.com", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "2028 (revised Kyber NVL144 launch timing, more than twelve months later than previously expected)", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "70:e1", "article": 70, "input_id": "gnews:d5c48abb470f394f86549b6b", "title": "Nvidia underperforms peers as report sparks rack delay worries", "publisher": "uk.finance.yahoo.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "Supply-chain research firm SemiAnalysis alleged in a weekend report that Nvidia's Kyber NVL144 rack architecture will be delayed to 2028 because of manufacturing challenges with its PCB midplane, as reported by Investing.com.", "passages": ["Supply chain research firm SemiAnalysis claimed in a weekend report that Nvidia's highly anticipated Kyber NVL144 rack architecture will be delayed to 2028 due to manufacturing challenges with its PCB midplane."], "verified_passages": ["Supply chain research firm SemiAnalysis claimed in a weekend report that Nvidia's highly anticipated Kyber NVL144 rack architecture will be delayed to 2028 due to manufacturing challenges with its PCB midplane."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "Investing.com", "tier": "rumour", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": "weekend report", "evidence_period": "2028", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "72:e1", "article": 72, "input_id": "gnews:d4c5dc540392f8df39aee250", "title": "Nvidia Delays Next-Generation Kyber Server Architecture as Manufacturing Hurdles Give Rivals a Rare Opening", "publisher": "tikr.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "Research firm SemiAnalysis reported that Nvidia's Kyber rack-scale server design — built to pack 144 of Nvidia's most powerful chips into a single cabinet and originally due to launch alongside Vera Rubin Ultra in 2027 — has been pushed back more than a year, from 2027 to 2028. SemiAnalysis attributed the holdup to manufacturing problems with a specialized circuit board inside the system. Nvidia did not respond to requests for comment.", "passages": ["Research firm SemiAnalysis reported that Kyber, Nvidia’s next rack-scale server design, has been pushed back more than a year , from 2027 to 2028.", "Kyber matters because it’s built to pack 144 of Nvidia’s most powerful chips into a single cabinet, letting them work together like one giant computer.", "The design was supposed to launch alongside Vera Rubin Ultra, Nvidia’s next-generation system, in 2027. The holdup comes down to manufacturing problems with a specialized circuit board inside the system, according to SemiAnalysis."], "verified_passages": ["Research firm SemiAnalysis reported that Kyber, Nvidia’s next rack-scale server design, has been pushed back more than a year , from 2027 to 2028.", "Kyber matters because it’s built to pack 144 of Nvidia’s most powerful chips into a single cabinet, letting them work together like one giant computer.", "The design was supposed to launch alongside Vera Rubin Ultra, Nvidia’s next-generation system, in 2027. The holdup comes down to manufacturing problems with a specialized circuit board inside the system, according to SemiAnalysis."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "tikr.com", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "Launch schedule moved from 2027 to 2028", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "73:e1", "article": 73, "input_id": "gnews:c0432377817a1c00a1bbadf0", "title": "Nvidia AI server delay report sends Asian tech stocks sliding", "publisher": "businesstimes.com.sg", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "Research firm SemiAnalysis said in an X post that Nvidia's Kyber NVL144 next-generation AI server rack system has been delayed by more than a year due to manufacturing difficulties, specifically setbacks in the construction of printed circuit boards for the platform. Nvidia did not respond to a request for comment. The item reports the delay claim is unconfirmed by Nvidia; the article reports the post landed as Asian tech stocks slumped.", "passages": ["Asian technology stocks slumped after a report that Nvidia’s next-generation AI server rack system has been delayed by more than a year due to manufacturing difficulties.", "Research firm SemiAnalysis said in an X post that Nvidia’s Kyber NVL144 hit setbacks in the construction of printed circuit boards for the platform. Nvidia did not respond to a request for comment outside of regular office hours."], "verified_passages": ["Asian technology stocks slumped after a report that Nvidia’s next-generation AI server rack system has been delayed by more than a year due to manufacturing difficulties.", "Research firm SemiAnalysis said in an X post that Nvidia’s Kyber NVL144 hit setbacks in the construction of printed circuit boards for the platform. Nvidia did not respond to a request for comment outside of regular office hours."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "SemiAnalysis (cited by Bloomberg via businesstimes.com.sg)", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "Kyber NVL144 (Rubin Ultra rack) launch timeline; reported delay of more than a year", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "75:e1", "article": 75, "input_id": "gnews:c75f16a6d64cc27fc28fb571", "title": "Nvidia's Kyber rack for Rubin Ultra reportedly delayed to 2028, stopgap solution also axed due to customer pushback — Analyst firm SemiAnalysis says PCB midplane problems led to the delay [Updated]", "publisher": "tomshardware.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "SemiAnalysis, in a thread on X, reported that Nvidia will not ship its Kyber NVL144 rack until 2028 — a delay of more than 12 months that pushes the cabinet meant for 2027's Rubin Ultra GPUs into the following year — with the holdup ostensibly caused by manufacturing challenges with a PCB midplane (the orthogonal backplane) that connects eight Oberon racks between the NVSwitches.", "passages": ["Nvidia reportedly won't ship its Kyber NVL144 rack until 2028, a delay of more than 12 months that pushes the cabinet meant for 2027's Rubin Ultra GPUs into the following year, according to a SemiAnalysis thread on X. The holdup is ostensibly being caused by manufacturing challenges with a PCB midplane that connects eight Oberon racks between the NVSwitches, which Nvidia calls the orthogonal backplane."], "verified_passages": ["Nvidia reportedly won't ship its Kyber NVL144 rack until 2028, a delay of more than 12 months that pushes the cabinet meant for 2027's Rubin Ultra GPUs into the following year, according to a SemiAnalysis thread on X. The holdup is ostensibly being caused by manufacturing challenges with a PCB midplane that connects eight Oberon racks between the NVSwitches, which Nvidia calls the orthogonal backplane."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "Luke James, Tom's Hardware", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "2027–2028", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "84:e1", "article": 84, "input_id": "gnews:b48593184704bbbe6eddbc03", "title": "As chip sector takes it on the chin, traders bet on a big Nvidia rally", "publisher": "cnbc.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-07", "summary": "A research report (named later in the item as SemiAnalysis) claimed that Nvidia is at least a year behind on manufacturing of its next line of server racks — the next-generation Kyber server rack — which the report said is running into delays.", "passages": ["Shares of Nvidia fought into the green despite a 5% sell-off in chip stocks tracked by the VanEck Semiconductor ETF (SMH) , a notable outperformance a day after a research report claiming the AI leader was at least a year behind on manufacturing of its next line of server racks.", "Similar action took place in Nvidia Monday after the company disputed a report by SemiAnalysis that its next-gen Kyber server rack was running into delays."], "verified_passages": ["Shares of Nvidia fought into the green despite a 5% sell-off in chip stocks tracked by the VanEck Semiconductor ETF (SMH) , a notable outperformance a day after a research report claiming the AI leader was at least a year behind on manufacturing of its next line of server racks.", "Similar action took place in Nvidia Monday after the company disputed a report by SemiAnalysis that its next-gen Kyber server rack was running into delays."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "CNBC", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": null, "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "92:e1", "article": 92, "input_id": "gnews:295fceb25273abae9bb6c995", "title": "A Circuit Board Problem Just Delayed Nvidia's Next AI System to 2028 And Chip Stocks Are Already Feeling the Fallout", "publisher": "247wallst.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-07", "summary": "Semiconductor research firm SemiAnalysis reported on July 5–6, 2026 (a post CNBC cited) that NVIDIA's Kyber NVL144 rack-scale AI system has been delayed from a planned 2027 launch to 2028. SemiAnalysis attributed the delay to manufacturing difficulty with the system's PCB midplane (orthogonal backplane), a printed circuit board of up to 78 layers, and also said the larger NVL576, which links eight racks via optical connections, is likely delayed or limited to small initial volumes.", "passages": ["Semiconductor research firm SemiAnalysis reported on July 5–6, 2026 that NVIDIA’s Kyber NVL144 rack-scale AI system has been delayed, from its planned 2027 launch to 2028. CNBC cited the SemiAnalysis post.", "A larger sibling, the NVL576, designed to link eight racks via optical connections, is also likely delayed or limited to small initial volumes, according to SemiAnalysis.", "The reported culprit is a component most retail investors have not heard of: the PCB midplane (which NVIDIA also calls the orthogonal backplane), a printed circuit board with up to 78 layers that connects electronic modules within the rack. SemiAnalysis said it “remains challenging from a manufacturability standpoint.”"], "verified_passages": ["Semiconductor research firm SemiAnalysis reported on July 5–6, 2026 that NVIDIA’s Kyber NVL144 rack-scale AI system has been delayed, from its planned 2027 launch to 2028. CNBC cited the SemiAnalysis post.", "A larger sibling, the NVL576, designed to link eight racks via optical connections, is also likely delayed or limited to small initial volumes, according to SemiAnalysis.", "The reported culprit is a component most retail investors have not heard of: the PCB midplane (which NVIDIA also calls the orthogonal backplane), a printed circuit board with up to 78 layers that connects electronic modules within the rack. SemiAnalysis said it “remains challenging from a manufacturability standpoint.”"], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "24/7 Wall St. (Danielle Liverance)", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": "July 5–6, 2026", "evidence_period": "2028 (delayed from planned 2027 launch)", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "132:e7", "article": 132, "input_id": "gnews:57de52b4f33b0c903d256f9e", "title": "DeepSeek Just Dealt Nvidia Stock a Potentially Major Blow", "publisher": "barchart.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-09", "summary": "Barchart reported that, recently, reports suggested Nvidia's next-generation Kyber rack-scale AI infrastructure — designed for the Rubin Ultra platform and expected to launch in 2027 — could be delayed until 2028.", "passages": ["Recently, Nvidia faced reports that suggested its next-generation Kyber rack-scale AI infrastructure could be delayed until 2028.", "Designed for the Rubin Ultra platform, Kyber is expected to launch in 2027 as an integrated AI infrastructure system and a key component of Nvidia's long-term AI infrastructure strategy."], "verified_passages": ["Recently, Nvidia faced reports that suggested its next-generation Kyber rack-scale AI infrastructure could be delayed until 2028.", "Designed for the Rubin Ultra platform, Kyber is expected to launch in 2027 as an integrated AI infrastructure system and a key component of Nvidia's long-term AI infrastructure strategy."], "original_party": "Unidentified reports (as relayed by barchart.com)", "reporting_speaker": "barchart.com", "tier": "rumour", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": "recently", "evidence_period": "2027-2028", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "184:e1", "article": 184, "input_id": "gnews:3cd991655d4cdeaa4a578b84", "title": "Did Nvidia's 2028 Rack Delay Under Jensen Huang Open a Door for AMD and Google?", "publisher": "fool.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-12", "summary": "Technology research firm SemiAnalysis reported that Nvidia's Kyber NVL144 next-generation AI rack system could be delayed until 2028 because of troubles manufacturing a crucial circuit board, per fool.com's account.", "passages": ["This has been a key part of CEO Jensen Huang's strategy; however, it could have hit a snag when technology research outfit SemiAnalysis reported that its Kyber NVL144 next-gen AI rack system could be delayed until 2028 due to troubles with manufacturing a crucial circuit board."], "verified_passages": ["This has been a key part of CEO Jensen Huang's strategy; however, it could have hit a snag when technology research outfit SemiAnalysis reported that its Kyber NVL144 next-gen AI rack system could be delayed until 2028 due to troubles with manufacturing a crucial circuit board."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "Geoffrey Seiler (fool.com)", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": "2028", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "239:e2", "article": 239, "input_id": "gnews:f83ae0a4f01c18d48f20a629", "title": "Tech Giants Take a Breather: Why Is Nvidia Stock Price Down Today?", "publisher": "ebc.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-14", "summary": "Over the weekend before the 2026-07-14 article, reports attributed to industry research firm SemiAnalysis circulated suggesting Nvidia's upcoming Kyber NVL144 architecture could face delays extending into 2028; the report is unconfirmed by Nvidia.", "passages": ["Over the weekend, reports circulated from industry research firm SemiAnalysis suggesting that Nvidia’s upcoming Kyber NVL144 architecture could face delays extending into 2028."], "verified_passages": ["Over the weekend, reports circulated from industry research firm SemiAnalysis suggesting that Nvidia’s upcoming Kyber NVL144 architecture could face delays extending into 2028."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "EBC (ebc.com), citing reports from SemiAnalysis", "tier": "rumour", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": "Over the weekend", "evidence_period": "2028", "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18", "v20"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}], "links": {"v18": "45:e1", "v20": "239:e2"}, "revises": []}, "45:e2": {"original": {"id": "45:e2", "article": 45, "input_id": "gnews:552f8c2bdfd080555d592587", "title": "Nvidia's next-gen AI rack system delayed to 2028 on manufacturing snags, SemiAnalysis says", "publisher": "cnbc.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-05", "summary": "Nvidia rejected SemiAnalysis's report that the Kyber NVL144 rack architecture has been delayed to 2028, stating, \"Our roadmap is intact.\"", "passages": ["Nvidia rejected the SemiAnalysis report and said, \"Our roadmap is intact.\""], "verified_passages": ["Nvidia rejected the SemiAnalysis report and said, \"Our roadmap is intact.\""], "original_party": "NVIDIA", "reporting_speaker": "NVIDIA, reported by CNBC", "tier": "party_statement", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": null, "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, "members": [{"id": "54:e3", "article": 54, "input_id": "gnews:68a3ed21f77b935d9fa7ec5e", "title": "Jim Cramer Says Buy Nvidia as Chipmaker Rejects 2028 AI Delay Claims", "publisher": "finance.yahoo.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-06", "summary": "Nvidia rejected SemiAnalysis's delay claims, telling media outlets that its roadmap remains intact.", "passages": ["Nvidia rejected the claims, telling media outlets that its roadmap remains intact."], "verified_passages": ["Nvidia rejected the claims, telling media outlets that its roadmap remains intact."], "original_party": "NVIDIA", "reporting_speaker": "finance.yahoo.com (Lockridge Okoth, beincrypto.com)", "tier": "party_statement", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": null, "evidence_period": n