om", "publication_date": "2026-07-08", "summary": "Research firm SemiAnalysis stated in an X post that NVIDIA's Kyber NVL144 rack system has hit manufacturing setbacks; the article adds that this could be further impetus for NVIDIA to deploy its new credit and revenue-sharing model. The claim is a third-party assertion, and NVIDIA's response is that its roadmap is intact.", "passages": ["NVIDIA’s stock also suffered this week because research firm SemiAnalysis stated in an X post that NVIDIA’s Kyber NVL144 rack system has hit manufacturing setbacks—a situation that could be further impetus for NVIDIA to deploy its new credit and revenue-sharing model, creating a continuing flow of demand for its products."], "verified_passages": ["NVIDIA’s stock also suffered this week because research firm SemiAnalysis stated in an X post that NVIDIA’s Kyber NVL144 rack system has hit manufacturing setbacks—a situation that could be further impetus for NVIDIA to deploy its new credit and revenue-sharing model, creating a continuing flow of demand for its products."], "original_party": "SemiAnalysis", "reporting_speaker": "Futuriom, citing SemiAnalysis on X", "tier": "third_party_view", "statement_date": null, "statement_date_text": "this week", "evidence_period": null, "figures": [], "thesis_ids": ["v18"], "unresolved_thesis_ids": []}, {"id": "132:e8", "article": 132, "input_id": "gnews:57de52b4f33b0c903d256f9e", "title": "DeepSeek Just Dealt Nvidia Stock a Potentially Major Blow", "publisher": "barchart.com", "publication_date": "2026-07-09", "summary": "Nvidia denied the speculation that its Kyber rack-scale AI infrastructure could be delayed until 2028, maintaining that its roadmap remains on track.", "passages": ["However, the company denied the speculation, maintaining that its roadmap remains on track."], "verified_passages": ["However, the company denied the speculation, maintaining that its roadmap remains on track."], "original_party": "NVIDIA Corporation", "reporting_spea